      "batch_node": {
        "name": "Gridkin fixture — hotlinks",
        "description": "A single batch that creates a page whose layout references two panel-ids, the two backing panel nodes, and both USES_PANEL hotlink edges. The deferred-hotlink mechanism (req-grid-hotlink-deferred) enqueues the page during its per-op validation and the pre-commit consistency phase (req-grid-service-batch-precommit-consistency) re-validates against the now-current edge set. The drain must see both edges to pass exact-mode hotlink validation; if the drain regresses (does not run, queries the wrong edges, attributes incorrectly), the fixture fails to import and the Gridkin scenario fails before the query runs.",
